# fixedbugs, defect 152, lane ffi-macro, 2026-10-02.
#
# SYMPTOM: declared and never called, `function errno() -> i32` was still
# `internal error`, exit 2, from the result assertion alone, the one line
# every `extern` function has and the one that carries no `#line`.
#
# FIX: the call is said again at the declaration's line whether or not the
